  <h1>An online Pomodoro Timer to boost your productivity</h1>
  <h2>What is Pomofocus?</h2>
  <p>Pomofocus is a customizable pomodoro timer that works on desktop &amp; mobile browser. The aim of this app is to help you focus on any task you are working on, such as study, writing, or coding. This app is inspired by <a href="#" class="btn">Pomodoro Technique</a> which is a time management method developed by Francesco Cirillo.</p>
